This software is intended for educational and demonstration purposes. 
Any use in production medical environments must comply with:

1. HIPAA (Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act) regulations
2. Local healthcare data protection laws
3. Medical device regulations in your jurisdiction
4. Professional medical licensing requirements

The developers and contributors of this software:
- Do NOT provide medical advice
- Are NOT responsible for medical decisions made using this software
- Recommend professional medical consultation for all health concerns
- Disclaim liability for any medical outcomes

AI/ML models included are for demonstration purposes and should be:
- Validated by medical professionals before clinical use
- Regularly updated and retrained with appropriate datasets
- Used only as decision support tools, not primary diagnostic tools
- Supervised by qualified healthcare professionals

By using this software, you acknowledge that:
- You understand the limitations of AI in healthcare
- You will not use this as a substitute for professional medical advice
- You accept full responsibility for any implementation decisions
- You will comply with all applicable healthcare regulations

For production medical use, please consult with:
- Healthcare legal counsel
